# Font Replacer categorization rules
# Format: merchant_pattern||category_id
# Pattern is case-insensitive substring match, first match wins.
#
# Seeded with known recurring merchants. New rules accumulate
# via the approve_and_learn mechanism as transactions are reviewed.
#
# Sales & Revenue (200)
stripe||200
shopify||200
gumroad||200

# Software & Subscriptions (461)
aws||461
github||461
vercel||461
cloudflare||461
google workspace||461

# Bank Fees (404)
wise||404

